@InterProc.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5084
@csrfToken = replace-with-XSRF-TOKEN-cookie-value

### Get session state and the CSRF request token
GET {{InterProc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/session
Accept: application/json

### Sign in
POST {{InterProc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "replace-with-temporary-password"
}

### Sign out
POST {{InterProc.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

###
